## 9. Memory Trick 🧠

> **"In Loki, the Chunk is the Cabinet. In Prometheus, the Block is the Cabinet."**
> 📦 Prometheus chunk = one labeled folder of samples for one series · 🗄️ Prometheus block = the whole filing cabinet drawer for a time period, holding every series' folders plus an index.

If you're ever unsure which system nests which way, remember: **"Loki's chunk holds blocks; Prometheus's block holds chunks."** Same two words, mirrored meaning.

